(41017,73480,'FH2122',NULL,'<p>This <a href=\"https://lis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?241+oth+HB457FH1122+PDF\">fiscal impact statement</a> does not provide an exact cost estimate for the legislation. However, it states that if the bill were to require additional Probation and Parole officers, funding of $76,811 general fund (includes salary and benefits) per officer would be required. The statement also mentions that the Office of the Attorney General may experience a fiscal impact due to potential litigation cases filed under the proposed bill, but the impact cannot be quantified at this time.</p>\n        <p class=\"openai\">Summary generated automatically by OpenAI.</p>','2025-01-12 03:10:40','2025-01-12 03:10:40');
